airs. Core Competencies Relationship Building Customer Service Communication Initiative Strategic Thinking Organization Recruitment and Sales Skills Data-Informed Decision Making EEO Statement McMurry University is committed to an educational and working environment that provides equal opportunity to all members of the university community and prohibits unlawful discrimination on the basis of race, color, gender, national origin, age, genetic information, disability or veteran status, in employment or the provision of services, in accordance with applicable federal, state and local laws. Discrimination on the basis of sexual orientation is also prohibited pursuant to University policy."
